<Styles xmlns="https://github.com/avaloniaui"
    xmlns:x="http://schemas.microsoft.com/winfx/2006/xaml">

    <!--
        LMP INTERFACE ARCHITECTURAL PHILOSOPHY

        1. CONTENT IS KING, UI IS A WEIGHTLESS FRAMEWORK:
            - Solid fills (BgElevatedBrush) and intrusive cards are forbidden.
            - Controls in idle state are completely transparent (Background="Transparent",
             BorderThickness="0"), creating no visual clutter around icons.
            - Depth is formed exclusively by thin 1px dividers (BgHighlightBrush).

        2. ZERO LAYOUT SHIFT:
            - Modifying BorderThickness, Margin, or Padding in dynamic pseudoclasses
             (:pointerover, :pressed) is strictly prohibited. Any border geometry
             changes trigger a layout pass invalidation (Measure/Arrange) and lead to
             physical jittering of adjacent UI elements.
            - Artificial scale transformations on interactive list buttons are forbidden
             to prevent subpixel blur of vector fonts.
            - Tactile feedback relies on brush kinetics (BrushTransition 0:0:0.15)
             and safe font weight toggling (FontWeight="Bold").

        3. CHROMATIC PURITY OF TRANSITIONS:
            - Animated transitions of borders (BorderBrush) and backgrounds are performed strictly
             between brushes sharing the identical RGB base (e.g., AccentTransparentBrush -> AccentBrush).
            - Transitions between heterogeneous spectra (Accent -> Gray) are forbidden,
             as alpha channel interpolation with intermediate colors produces a dirty flicker effect.

        4. COLOR SYSTEM AND SEMANTICS:
            - BgPrimaryBrush: base background for application and dialogs.
            - BgHighlightBrush: thin dividers for headers and lists (1px).
            - AccentBrush / AccentHoverBrush: vector icon glow on hover,
             active states, input focus.
            - SystemErrorBrush: destructive actions and fatal errors.
            - SystemWarnOrangeBrush: warnings and non-standard modes.

        5. GEOMETRY AND CORNER RADII:
            - 12px: modal dialogs and top-level windows.
            - 8px: playlist cards, track covers, popup menus.
            - 6px: inputs, chips, stream selection buttons.
            - 0px / Circle (999px): frameless media control and navigation buttons.

        6. HIGH-PERFORMANCE TYPOGRAPHY:
            - Hierarchy: 28/22 (Headers), 14/13 (Body, inputs, titles), 12/11 (Metadata).
            - Mandatory use of TextTrimming="CharacterEllipsis" on all
             single-line data strings with support for full tooltips (ToolTip.Tip).
    -->

    <Style>
        <Style.Resources>
            <BoxShadows x:Key="CardShadow">0 4 8 0 #40000000</BoxShadows>
        </Style.Resources>
    </Style>

    <!-- IMPORT SPLIT THEMES -->
    <StyleInclude Source="avares://LMP/UI/Theme/Typography.axaml" />
    <StyleInclude Source="avares://LMP/UI/Theme/Buttons.axaml" />
    <StyleInclude Source="avares://LMP/UI/Theme/Controls.axaml" />
    <StyleInclude Source="avares://LMP/UI/Theme/AppComponents.axaml" />
    <StyleInclude Source="avares://LMP/UI/Theme/LoadingSkeletons.axaml" />
    <!-- PlayerBarStyles AFTER AppComponents — overrides vol-* styles -->
    <StyleInclude Source="avares://LMP/UI/Features/Player/PlayerBarStyles.axaml" />

    <Style Selector="Window">
        <Setter Property="Background" Value="{DynamicResource BgPrimaryBrush}" />
        <Setter Property="Foreground" Value="{DynamicResource TextPrimaryBrush}" />
        <Setter Property="FontFamily" Value="Segoe UI, sans-serif" />
    </Style>

</Styles>